menu "Scene Narrator"

    config SCENE_NARRATOR_SIMULATE
        bool "Enable hardware simulation mode"
        default n
        help
            Run without physical camera, audio, or button hardware.
            Useful for development on ESP-IDF simulator or CI.
            Disable for real ESP32-P4 hardware deployment.

    config SCENE_NARRATOR_BATTERY_MONITOR
        bool "Enable battery voltage monitoring"
        default n
        help
            Read battery voltage from GPIO ADC with 2:1 divider.
            Disable if no voltage divider is wired to avoid false shutdowns.

endmenu
